"""Type stubs for the ``rivex_core`` PyO3 extension module.

This file describes the public Python API surface exposed by the
``rivex-python`` Rust crate. It is shipped inside the ``rivex-core``
wheel so type checkers (mypy, pyright) and IDEs can resolve symbols.
"""

